# E-commerce Sales Analytics (SQL + Python + Tableau)

## Goal
Analyze e-commerce sales data to find key revenue drivers and insights across geography, devices, and traffic channels.

## Tools
- SQL (Google BigQuery)
- Python (Pandas, SciPy, Matplotlib)
- Tableau Public

## Deliverables
- Jupyter notebooks (data extraction, EDA, statistics)
- Tableau dashboard (2 pages)

## Key Questions
- Top continents/countries by sales and orders
- Top product categories by sales
- Sales share by device and traffic channel
- Sales dynamics over time + seasonality
- Correlation: sessions vs sales
- Differences: registered vs non-registered users (statistical tests)

